sequenceDiagram
    participant User as CLI User
    participant CLI as odh-cli / rhai-cli
    participant Agent as MCP Agent<br/>(Claude, GPT)
    participant MCP as MCP Server<br/>stdio / 8080/TCP
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant TrustYAI as TrustYAI Service<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant GitHub as raw.githubusercontent.com<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant FS as Local Filesystem

    Note over User,FS: Flow 1: Lint / Upgrade Readiness Assessment
    User->>CLI: odh lint --target-version X.Y
    CLI->>K8s: GET CRDs, Deployments, CSVs<br/>Auth: kubeconfig credentials
    K8s-->>CLI: Cluster state
    CLI->>CLI: Run pluggable checks<br/>(components, services, deps, workloads)
    CLI-->>User: Lint report (stdout)<br/>Severity: prohibited/critical/warning/info

    Note over Agent,K8s: Flow 2: MCP Agent Integration
    Agent->>MCP: JSON-RPC tool call<br/>(stdio or SSE 8080/TCP)
    MCP->>MCP: toolAdapter maps to Command<br/>Complete / Validate / Run
    MCP->>K8s: HTTPS 6443/TCP<br/>Auth: kubeconfig credentials
    K8s-->>MCP: API response
    MCP-->>Agent: JSON-RPC result<br/>(structured output)

    Note over User,FS: Flow 3: Migration Execution
    User->>CLI: odh migrate --target-version X.Y
    CLI->>CLI: RBAC pre-flight<br/>SelfSubjectAccessReview
    CLI->>K8s: Backup phase: GET resources<br/>Auth: kubeconfig credentials
    K8s-->>CLI: Resources to migrate
    CLI->>FS: Write backup YAML<br/>File I/O
    CLI->>K8s: Prepare phase: validate state<br/>Auth: kubeconfig credentials
    CLI->>TrustYAI: Metrics backup<br/>Auth: Bearer token<br/>TLS 1.2+ (InsecureSkipVerify)
    TrustYAI-->>CLI: Metrics data
    CLI->>K8s: Run phase: apply migrations<br/>Auth: kubeconfig credentials
    K8s-->>CLI: Migration results
    CLI-->>User: Migration report (stdout)

    Note over CLI,GitHub: Dependency Manifest Refresh
    User->>CLI: odh deps --refresh
    CLI->>GitHub: GET values.yaml at pinned commit<br/>HTTPS 443/TCP, No auth
    GitHub-->>CLI: Dependency manifest
    CLI->>K8s: Install operators via OLM<br/>Auth: kubeconfig credentials
    K8s-->>CLI: OLM operation result
    CLI-->>User: Dependency status
